title	Staff Software Engineer, Platform
organization	Lumenpay GmbH
location	Berlin, Germany
date	Mar 2021 – Present
bullet	Led the design and rollout of a progressive delivery system for 180 services, cutting failed production deploys by 64% in its first year.
bullet	Set up the payments reliability programme: SLOs for 14 critical flows, an error-budget policy agreed with product, and a weekly review I still chair.
bullet	Drove the migration of the ledger from a single PostgreSQL primary to a sharded CockroachDB cluster with no customer-visible downtime.
bullet	Cut the platform group's cloud spend by €1.1M a year by rightsizing Kubernetes node pools and moving batch jobs to spot instances.
bullet	Mentor six engineers across three teams; two have since been promoted to senior.
bullet	Wrote Lumenpay's incident review guide and trained 40 incident commanders.
